  "answer": "The target-leakage bug in TriageIQ's resolution-time predictor was caused by the train/test split dividing issues by closed_at, which guaranteed that any issue still open at the cutoff date landed in the test set and every already-resolved issue landed in train. Fixing this bug by re-splitting by created_at collapsed the mean absolute error from 693 days to 87 days, an 8x improvement.",
